Browser shield
==============
Brave adblock-rust 0.13.5 (MPL-2.0), Rust 1.99.1 runtime, Raymond Hill and uBlock Origin
contributors' scriptlets (GPL-3.0-or-later), and the EasyList authors' filters are used by
the browser. Source offers, exact upstream revisions, list-specific attributions and changes:
app/src/main/assets/adblock/SOURCES.txt. The APK also carries COPYING-uBlock.txt and
native-notices.zip with the complete locked native dependency notices and source URLs.
No Orbit sources, resources or prebuilt libraries are distributed.
